  // Sea ice at a direction (paleoDir) and latitude (px: the view's radians per pixel) —
  // a Snowball Earth's "sea glaciers", and the ice ages' pack ice. Snow where it fell:
  // all but the tropics, whose dry air took (sublimated) more than fell; there, bare
  // pale-blue glacier ice streaked north–south by its slow flow from the poles, smeared
